                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a38751cf-d518-4c12-82b6-1bf08b17e41c",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d5981f8-bf99-357f-8672-90558ae27ec1",
                        "source_sense_id": "2828b8bc-2587-3232-ae52-36f35282fe63",
                        "target_lang_word": "arachibutyrophobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arachibutyrophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                        "entry_id": "4b7841c5-1e5d-3759-9842-6d5b2f1a99b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fear of peanut butter sticking to the roof of one's mouth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous",
                                            "rare",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eab274bc-fac7-4a6c-ab8e-43405aa88037",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Similarly, arachibutyrophobia, the fear of peanut butter sticking to the roof of your mouth, can probably be dealt with by not eating peanut butter, or just eating it carefully."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6be2f5f7-060a-4b3a-a67f-df7a81062412",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Look, if people can suffer from arachibutyrophobia, which is the fear of peanut butter sticking to the roof of the mouth, then I have no doubt there's a clinical name for being afraid to leave your baby with a sitter for a half hour while you run to 7-Eleven."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3eb09c7-8d52-4c41-8649-6c6d9db03d9d",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Imagine the situation had this bear suffered from arachibutyrophobia!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfe51fea-49c8-4fc3-b6a1-6ac30ea0d83a",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Odds and ends I've come across in the course of an education: That arachibutyrophobia is an unnatural fear of peanut butter sticking to the roof of your mouth. I have no idea how many people suffer from this."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a398552d-41e1-4803-a9db-4bd6b445a054",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Her ARACHIBUTYROPHOBIA had been getting worse lately. She finally chose a jar of creamy style peanut butter, knowing it would never be opened once she got it home."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8191077d-5e70-492c-8823-3d6dc5671d94",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Do you suffer from Arachibutyrophobia? Or does peanut butter just freak you out?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eede6ea7-7e1e-4c5c-98a0-ba665aca8481",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "He took a bite of sandwich, chewed, and grinned at her. \"Arachibutyrophobia. Look it up.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7577092a-1dce-42c3-8c22-e8f06a48d37f",
                                                "sense_id": "c26ee5d9-c804-3caa-924d-4925bf1c19ce",
                                                "text": "Arachibutyrophobia—fear of peanut butter being stuck to the top of your mouth. [...] Trust me when I say there is a fear of everything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
